Separate asset and third-party licenses
--------------------------------------
The prepared MakeHuman/MPFB graphical data in assets/ (meshes, morph targets,
skin weights, rig data, eyes texture and face attachments) are CC0 1.0, not
covered by the project-code MIT grant. Source provenance and upstream license
links are retained in assets/human.manifest.json, assets/rig.manifest.json and
assets/face.manifest.json. CC0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Three.js and its controls in vendor/ are MIT-licensed by their upstream
contributors. Preserve vendor/THREE-LICENSE.txt when redistributing them.

Authoring source directories and their GPL-licensed program code are not
runtime dependencies and are intentionally excluded from node installation.
